{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This Demo lets you step into Chapter IV of <i>The Protagonist</i>.</strong><br>You will wander through the fractured corridors of Varon Orimir\u2019s mind, guided \u2014 and tormented \u2014 by his own inner demon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting whispers confront you with his past:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The disappearance of his daughter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The death of his wife.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The unbearable guilt that nothing could have changed these fates.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over the course of <strong>15\u201325 minutes</strong>, you\u2019ll experience an atmospheric descent into memory, regret, and distorted reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created with care by the two-person studio <strong>BeforeYouKnowGames</strong>, this demo offers a first taste of the psychological horror and emotional storytelling that define <i>The Protagonist</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enjoy the ride \u2014 but don\u2019t lose yourself in the subconscious.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980590/extras/1737b8cf773db9a71535bdb2d76920da.avif?t=1757691474\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980590?t=1757691474","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3980590?t=1757691474","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980590/14123c0cf5f3ab1474869e6cea7d9359a3523fb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757691474","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980590/14123c0cf5f3ab1474869e6cea7d9359a3523fb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757691474","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"desc